  {
   "id": "a19-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 764,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How it works: the protected link brings its shared links along",
   "originalText": "How it works: the protected link brings its shared links along",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a19-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 981,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A link lists its groups (srlg: [duct-1]). For S–E, the shared links are the other links with a group in\ncommon: here A–B. Both directions fail.",
   "originalText": "A link lists its groups (srlg: [duct-1]). For S–E, the shared links are the other links with a group in\ncommon: here A–B. Both directions fail.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a19-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 219,
   "width": 644,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "avoids shared link u→v:  dist(X,Y) < dist(X,u) + c(u,v) + dist(v,Y)\n(a tie counts as \"may use it\", as in B1)",
   "originalText": "avoids shared link u→v:  dist(X,Y) < dist(X,u) + c(u,v) + dist(v,Y)\n(a tie counts as \"may use it\", as in B1)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a19-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 269,
   "width": 981,
   "height": 128,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  TI-LFA (RFC 9855 §1): the post-convergence SPF also removes A–B; every segment must avoid it too.\n•  LFA (RFC 7916 §6.2.4.1): SRLG-disjoint candidates rank first (S→N is not shared, and N’s path avoids\n   every shared link), then the usual order (B7). A candidate in the SRLG is still an LFA for the link\n   alone.\n•  Remote LFA: the PQ node is picked as usual (RFC 7490 has no SRLG rule), then checked. If the tunnel\n   and the PQ node’s path avoid A–B, it also counts as SRLG protection.",
   "originalText": "•  TI-LFA (RFC 9855 §1): the post-convergence SPF also removes A–B; every segment must avoid it too.\n•  LFA (RFC 7916 §6.2.4.1): SRLG-disjoint candidates rank first (S→N is not shared, and N’s path avoids\n   every shared link), then the usual order (B7). A candidate in the SRLG is still an LFA for the link\n   alone.\n•  Remote LFA: the PQ node is picked as usual (RFC 7490 has no SRLG rule), then checked. If the tunnel\n   and the PQ node’s path avoid A–B, it also counts as SRLG protection.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a19-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 407,
   "width": 266,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "S → D: the two candidates",
   "originalText": "S → D: the two candidates",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a19-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 441,
   "width": 798,
   "height": 88,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "N  Loop-free         Node-protecting        SRLG-disjoint                                  Cost\n-  ----------------  ---------------------  ---------------------------------------------  ----\nA  2 < 1+2  ✓        2 < 2+1  ✓             A’s path A-B-D uses A–B  ✗                     3\nC  3 < 3+2  ✓        3 < 4+1  ✓             3 < dist(C,A)+1+dist(B,D) = 4+1+1 = 6  ✓       6\n                                            3 < dist(C,B)+1+dist(A,D) = 4+1+2 = 7  ✓",
   "originalText": "N  Loop-free         Node-protecting        SRLG-disjoint                                  Cost\n-  ----------------  ---------------------  ---------------------------------------------  ----\nA  2 < 1+2  ✓        2 < 2+1  ✓             A’s path A-B-D uses A–B  ✗                     3\nC  3 < 3+2  ✓        3 < 4+1  ✓             3 < dist(C,A)+1+dist(B,D) = 4+1+1 = 6  ✓       6\n                                            3 < dist(C,B)+1+dist(A,D) = 4+1+2 = 7  ✓",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a19-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 539,
   "width": 693,
   "height": 38,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
